ove GitLab, we would like to periodically [ collect usage information ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md) . This can be changed at any time in [ your settings ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling#js-usage-settings) . \\n\\n[ Send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=1&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=1) [ Don't send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=0&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=0)\\n\\n  1. <::after> [ Administrator  ](/root)\\n  2. <::after> [ bustub  ](/root/bustub)\\n  3. [ General Settings  ](/root/bustub/edit)\\n\\n\\n\\n#  General Settings \\n\\nCollapse \\n\\n##  Naming, description, topics \\n\\nUpdate your project name, description, avatar, and topics. [ Learn more about projects ](/help/user/project/working_with_projects.md) . \\n\\n<::before><::after>\\n\\nProject name  Must start with letter, digit, emoji, or underscore. Can also contain periods, dashes, spaces, and parentheses. \\n\\nProject ID \\n\\nB \\n\\nProject avatar  Choose file\u2026  No file chosen. \\n\\nThe ideal image size is 192 x 192 pixels. The maximum file size allowed is 200 KiB. \\n\\nThe maximum file size is 200 KiB. \\n\\nProject description (optional)  The BusTub Relational Database Management System (Educational)\\n\\nRepository size limit (MiB) \\n\\nWant to use this feature for free?  Read more about the [ Registration Features Program ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md#registration-features-program) . \\n\\nProject topics \\n\\n  * No matches found \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nTopics are publicly visible even on private projects. Do not include sensitive information in topic names. [ Learn more ](/help/user/project/project_topics) . \\n\\nSave changes \\n\\nExpand \\n\\n##  Visibility, project features, permissions \\n\\nChoose visibility level, enable/disable project features and their permissions, disable email notifications, and show default emoji reactions. \\n\\n<::before><::after>\\n\\nProject visibility \\n\\nManage who can see the project in the public access directory.  [ Learn more ](/help/user/public_access.md) . \\n\\nPrivate  Internal  Public \\n\\nAccessible by anyone, regardless of authentication. \\n\\n**Additional options** Users can request access \\n\\nIssues \\n\\nFlexible tool to collaboratively develop ideas and plan work in this project.  [ Learn more ](/help/user/project/issues/index.md) . \\n\\nIssues \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nRepository \\n\\nView and edit files in this project. When set to **Everyone With Access** non-project members have only read access. \\n\\nRepository \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nMerge requests \\n\\nSubmit changes to be merged upstream. \\n\\nMerge requests \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nForks \\n\\nUsers can copy the repository to a new project. \\n\\nForks \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nGit Large File Storage (LFS) \\n\\nManages large files such as audio, video, and graphics files.  [ Learn more ](/help/topics/git/lfs/index.md) . \\n\\nGit Large File Storage (LFS) \\n\\nCI/CD \\n\\nBuild, test, and deploy your changes. Does not apply to project integrations. \\n\\nCI/CD \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nAnalytics \\n\\nView project analytics. \\n\\nAnalytics \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nSecurity and compliance \\n\\nSecurity and compliance for this project. \\n\\nSecurity and compliance \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nWiki \\n\\nPages for project documentation. \\n\\nWiki \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nSnippets \\n\\nShare code with others outside the project. \\n\\nSnippets \\n\\nOnly Project Members  Everyone With Access \\n\\nPackage registry \\n\\nPublish, store, and view packages in a project.  [ Learn more ](/help/user