quire TLS 1.2 or higher. Weaker ciphers are no longer supported. Encryption must have at least of 112 bits of security. [ Learn more ](https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/update/versions/gitlab_17_changes.html#1770) . \\n\\nAcknowledge \\n\\n<::before>\\n\\nTo help improve GitLab, we would like to periodically [ collect usage information ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md) . This can be changed at any time in [ your settings ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling#js-usage-settings) . \\n\\n[ Send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=1&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=1) [ Don't send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=0&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=0)\\n\\n  1. <::after> [ Admin area  ](/admin)\\n  2. [ Runners  ](/admin/runners)\\n\\n\\n\\n#  Runners \\n\\n[ New instance runner  ](/admin/runners/new)\\n\\nRegister an instance runner \\n\\n* Registration token \\n\\nSupport for registration tokens is deprecated \\n\\n*   * Show runner installation and registration instructions \\n\\n\\n*   * Reset registration token \\n\\n\\n\\n  * <::before> All  0 \\n  * <::before> Instance  0 \\n  * <::before> Group  0 \\n  * <::before> Project  0 \\n\\n\\n\\nToggle history \\n\\nRecent searches \\n\\nYou don't have any recent searches \\n\\nCreated date \\n\\n  *   *   * Created date \\n  * Last contact \\n  *   * \\n\\n\\n#  Get started with runners \\n\\nRunners are the agents that run your CI/CD jobs. [ Create a new runner ](/admin/runners/new) to get started.   \\nStill using registration tokens? \\n\", url='http://the-agent-company.com:8929/admin/runners', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', error=False, observation='browse', goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:8929/admin/runners'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"goto('http://the-agent-company.com:8929/admin/runners')\\nnoop