ests \\n\\n    * [ Assigned  7  ](/dashboard/merge_requests?assignee_username=root)\\n    * [ Review requests  157  ](/dashboard/merge_requests?reviewer_username=root)\\n\\n\\n\\n[ ](/dashboard/todos)\\n\\nSearch or go to\u2026 \\n\\nAdmin area \\n\\n  * Overview \\n\\n    * [ Dashboard  ](/admin)\\n    * [ Projects  ](/admin/projects)\\n    * [ Users  ](/admin/users)\\n    * [ Groups  ](/admin/groups)\\n    * [ Topics  ](/admin/topics)\\n    * [ Gitaly servers  ](/admin/gitaly_servers)\\n\\n  * CI/CD \\n\\n    * [ Runners  ](/admin/runners)\\n    * [ Jobs  ](/admin/jobs)\\n\\n  * Analytics \\n\\n    * [ DevOps Reports  ](/admin/dev_ops_reports)\\n    * [ Usage trends  ](/admin/usage_trends)\\n\\n  * Monitoring \\n\\n    * [ System information  ](/admin/system_info)\\n    * [ Background migrations  ](/admin/background_migrations)\\n    * [ Background jobs  ](/admin/background_jobs)\\n    * [ Health check  ](/admin/health_check)\\n\\n  * [ Messages  ](/admin/broadcast_messages)\\n  * [ System hooks  ](/admin/hooks)\\n  * [ Applications  ](/admin/applications)\\n  * [ Abuse reports  0  ](/admin/abuse_reports)\\n  * [ Deploy keys  ](/admin/deploy_keys)\\n  * [ Labels  ](/admin/labels)\\n  * * * *\\n\\nSettings \\n\\n    * [ General  ](/admin/application_settings/general)\\n    * [ Integrations  ](/admin/application_settings/integrations)\\n    * [ Repository  ](/admin/application_settings/repository)\\n    * [ CI/CD  ](/admin/application_settings/ci_cd)\\n    * [ Reporting  ](/admin/application_settings/reporting)\\n    * [ Metrics and profiling  ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling)\\n    * [ Network  ](/admin/application_settings/network)\\n    * [ Appearance  ](/admin/application_settings/appearance)\\n    * [ Preferences  ](/admin/application_settings/preferences)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nHelp \\n\\n  *     * [ Help  ](/help)\\n    * [ Support  ](https://about.gitlab.com/get-help/)\\n    * [ GitLab documentation  ](/help/docs)\\n    * [ Compare GitLab plans  ](