age_statistics.md) . This can be changed at any time in [ your settings ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling#js-usage-settings) . \\n\\n[ Send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=1&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=1) [ Don't send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=0&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=0)\\n\\n  1. <::after> [ Administrator  ](/root)\\n  2. <::after> [ bustub  ](/root/bustub)\\n  3. [ General Settings  ](/root/bustub/edit)\\n\\n\\n\\n#  General Settings \\n\\nCollapse \\n\\n##  Naming, description, topics \\n\\nUpdate your project name, description, avatar, and topics. [ Learn more about projects ](/help/user/project/working_with_projects.md) . \\n\\n<::before><::after>\\n\\nProject name  Must start with letter, digit, emoji, or underscore. Can also contain periods, dashes, spaces, and parentheses. \\n\\nProject ID \\n\\nB \\n\\nProject avatar  Choose file\u2026  No file chosen. \\n\\nThe ideal image size is 192 x 192 pixels. The maximum file size allowed is 200 KiB. \\n\\nThe maximum file size is 200 KiB. \\n\\nProject description (optional)  The BusTub Relational Database Management System (Educational)\\n\\nRepository size limit (MiB) \\n\\nWant to use this feature for free?  Read more about the [ Registration Features Program ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md#registration-features-program) . \\n\\nProject topics \\n\\n  * No matches found \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nTopics are publicly visible even on private projects. Do not include sensitive information in topic names. [ Learn more ](/help/user/project/project_topics) . \\n\\nSave changes \\n\\nExpand \\n\\n##  Visibility, project features, permissions \\n\\nChoose visibility level, enable/disable project features and their permissions, disable email notifications, and show default emoji reactions. \\n\\n<::before><::after>\\n\\nProject visibility